 modes.\", \"sku\": \"BL-3DL250\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-3dl250\", \"category\": \"naked-eye-3d\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-3dl250.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 3000, \"highPrice\": 20000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-3dl250\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1,500 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"1920 x 1080 per face\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which ensures a high pixel density for crisp and detailed 3D visuals. A smaller pixel pitch delivers sharper images, ideal for close viewing distances in indoor environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the advanced parallax barrier technology work in this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The advanced parallax barrier technology creates a 3D effect without the need for glasses by directing different images to each eye. This enables viewers to experience a natural 3D view within a 90-degree viewing cone.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the display switch between 2D and 3D content in real time?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the NakedEye 3D Wall supports real-time mode switching between 2D and 3D content, allowing flexible usage scenarios without interruptions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display is designed for indoor flat-wall installation in controlled environments such as malls or showrooms. It requires stable mounting and access to power and data connections, with professional installation recommended for optimal results.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the brightness of 1,500 nits benefit indoor applications?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With 1,500 nits brightness, the display delivers vivid and bright images that remain clear even in well-lit indoor spaces like exhibition halls and shopping malls.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a warranty or support provided with the NakedEye 3D Wall?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty and support package tailored to this product, ensuring reliable performance and peace of mind throughout the product lifecycle.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the NakedEye 3D Wall compare to traditional 3D displays requiring glasses?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional 3D displays that require glasses, the NakedEye 3D Wall uses parallax barrier technology to deliver glasses-free 3D viewing, enhancing user convenience and engagement without accessory limitations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the best use cases for the NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This display is perfect for high-impact visual experiences in indoor malls, showrooms, and exhibitions where immersive 3D content can attract attention and enhance customer engagement.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-3dl250\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm</h1><p>Upgrade to NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm LED display in Dubai. Premium 3D visuals by Brightluxx. Get a free consultation in the UAE today!</p><p><strong>Flat-wall 3D. No glasses. Pure spectacle.</strong></p><p>High-resolution flat-wall naked-eye 3D display with advanced parallax barrier technology. 2.5mm pitch delivers crisp 3D visuals for indoor malls, showrooms, and exhibition halls. Supports real-time content switching between 2D and 3D modes.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm and why is it important?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which ensures a high pixel density for crisp and detailed 3D visuals. A smaller pixel pitch delivers sharper images, ideal for close viewing distances in indoor environments.</p><h3>How does the advanced parallax barrier technology work in this display?</h3><p>The advanced parallax barrier technology creates a 3D effect without the need for glasses by directing different images to each eye. This enables viewers to experience a natural 3D view within a 90-degree viewing cone.</p><h3>Can the display switch between 2D and 3D content in real time?</h3><p>Yes, the NakedEye 3D Wall supports real-time mode switching between 2D and 3D content, allowing flexible usage scenarios without interruptions.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements for this LED display?</h3><p>The display is designed for indoor flat-wall installation in controlled environments such as malls or showrooms. It requires stable mounting and access to power and data connections, with professional installation recommended for optimal results.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"bl-3dl250\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/bl-3dl250\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"script-0\\\",{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\",\\\"async\\\":true,\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\