alue\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Tb1a,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which ensures a high pixel density for crisp and detailed 3D visuals. A smaller pixel pitch delivers sharper images, ideal for close viewing distances in indoor environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the advanced parallax barrier technology work in this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The advanced parallax barrier technology creates a 3D effect without the need for glasses by directing different images to each eye. This enables viewers to experience a natural 3D view within a 90-degree viewing cone.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the display switch between 2D and 3D content in real time?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the NakedEye 3D Wall supports real-time mode switching between 2D and 3D content, allowing flexible usage scenarios without interruptions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display is designed for indoor flat-wall installation in controlled environments such as malls or showrooms. It requires stable mounting and access to power and data connections, with professional installation recommended for optimal results.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the brightness of 1,500 nits benefit indoor applications?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With 1,500 nits brightness, the display delivers vivid and bright images that remain clear even in well-lit indoor spaces like exhibition halls and shopping malls.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a warranty or support provided with the NakedEye 3D Wall?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty and support package tailored to this product, ensuring reliable performance and peace of mind throughout the product lifecycle.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the NakedEye 3D Wall compare to traditional 3D displays requiring glasses?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional 3D displays that require glasses, the NakedEye 3D Wall uses parallax barrier technology to deliver glasses-free 3D viewing, enhancing user convenience and engagement without accessory limitations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the best use cases for the NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This display is perfect for high-impact visual experiences in indoor malls, showrooms, and exhibitions where immersive 3D content can attract attention and enhance customer engagement.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-3dl250\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T663,<h1>NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm</h1><p>Upgrade to NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm LED display in Dubai. Premium 3D visuals by Brightluxx. Get a free consultation in the UAE today!</p><p><strong>Flat-wall 3D. No glasses. Pure spectacle.</strong></p><p>High-resolution flat-wall naked-eye 3D display with advanced parallax barrier technology. 2.5mm pitch delivers crisp 3D visuals for indoor malls, showrooms, and exhibition halls. Supports real-time content switching between 2D and 3D modes.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm and why is it important?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which ensures a high pixel density for crisp and detailed 3D visuals. A smaller pixel pitch delivers sharper images, ideal for close viewing distances in indoor environments.</p><h3>How does the advanced parallax barrier technology work in this display?</h3><p>The advanced parallax barrier technology creates a 3D effect without the need for glasses by directing different images to each eye. This enables viewers to experience a natural 3D view within a 90-degree viewing cone.</p><h3>Can the display switch between 2D and 3D content in real time?</h3><p>Yes, the NakedEye 3D Wall supports real-time mode switching between 2D and 3D content, allowing flexible usage scenarios without interruptions.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements for this LED display?</h3><p>The display is designed for indoor flat-wall installation in controlled environments such as malls or showrooms. It requires stable mounting and access to power and data connections, with professional installation recommended for optimal results.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dang