Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Tb1a,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which ensures a high pixel density for crisp and detailed 3D visuals. A smaller pixel pitch delivers sharper images, ideal for close viewing distances in indoor environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the advanced parallax barrier technology work in this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The advanced parallax barrier technology creates a 3D effect without the need for glasses by directing different images to each eye. This enables viewers to experience a natural 3D view within a 90-degree viewing cone.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the display switch between 2D and 3D content in real time?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the NakedEye 3D Wall supports real-time mode switching between 2D and 3D content, allowing flexible usage scenarios without interruptions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display is designed for indoor flat-wall installation in controlled environments such as malls or showrooms. It requires stable mounting and access to power and data connections, with professional installation recommended for optimal results.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the brightness of 1,500 nits benefit indoor applications?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With 1,500 nits brightness, the display delivers vivid and bright images that remain clear even in well-lit indoor spaces like exhibition halls and shopping malls.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \