howrooms, and exhibition halls. Supports real-time content switching between 2D and 3D modes.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm and why is it important?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which ensures a high pixel density for crisp and detailed 3D visuals. A smaller pixel pitch delivers sharper images, ideal for close viewing distances in indoor environments.</p><h3>How does the advanced parallax barrier technology work in this display?</h3><p>The advanced parallax barrier technology creates a 3D effect without the need for glasses by directing different images to each eye. This enables viewers to experience a natural 3D view within a 90-degree viewing cone.</p><h3>Can the display switch between 2D and 3D content in real time?</h3><p>Yes, the NakedEye 3D Wall supports real-time mode switching between 2D and 3D content, allowing flexible usage scenarios without interruptions.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements for this LED display?</h3><p>The display is designed for indoor flat-wall installation in controlled environments such as malls or showrooms. It requires stable mounting and access to power and data connections, with professional installation recommended for optimal results.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"NakedEye 3D Wall 2.5mm LED Display Dubai | Brightluxx UAE\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Upgrade to NakedEye